  "title": "NMT: Neurodiagnostic Montage Template Scalp EEG",
  "description": "The NMT (Neurodiagnostic Montage Template) Scalp EEG Dataset comprises 2,417 clinical EEG recordings acquired using the standard 10-20 electrode montage with 19 EEG channels plus 2 reference electrodes. This dataset includes both normal and abnormal EEG recordings in EDF format with variable sampling rates and durations, designed to support machine learning applications for EEG-based pathology detection and normal/abnormal classification tasks.",
